    <section class="rich-text-content-block homepage-testimonials">
        <div class="container-fluid">
            <div class="homepage-testimonials__header">

                    <div class="homepage-testimonials__header-title">
                        
<span id="content-1780065156485" class="fui-Primitive ___11tzqds f1oy3dpc f89hs3r fqtknz5 fyvcxda" dir="auto" aria-label="Real reviews. Real results">Real reviews. Real results.</span>
                    </div>

            </div>

                <div class="homepage-testimonials__carousel" data-testimonials-carousel>
                    <div class="homepage-testimonials__viewport">
                        <div class="homepage-testimonials__cards">
                            

<div class="homepage-testimonials__card-inner">
    <div class="homepage-testimonials__card-left">
            <div class="homepage-testimonials__card-image">
                <img src="/contentassets/2293eb63e9d34370a913cde23838fbcc/home-review-logo.png" alt="" />
            </div>

    </div>

        <div class="homepage-testimonials__card-content rich-text-area">
            
<p>&ldquo;Icertis has helped improve visibility, consistency, and control over contracts, which has helped streamline legal and business processes while reducing operational risk through standardized workflows and access controls.&rdquo;&nbsp;</p>
<p>- <a style="color: #fff; text-decoration: underline !important; white-space: nowrap;" href="https://www.gartner.com/reviews/market/contract-life-cycle-management/vendor/icertis/product/icertis-contract-intelligence-ici/review/view/6657302" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">IT Services customer</a> <strong> with more than $30 billion in annual revenue.</strong></p>
        </div>
</div>

<div class="homepage-testimonials__card-inner">
    <div class="homepage-testimonials__card-left">
            <div class="homepage-testimonials__card-image">
                <img src="/globalassets/home-review-logo.png" alt="" />
            </div>

    </div>

        <div class="homepage-testimonials__card-content rich-text-area">
            
<p>"Icertis has delivered as promised. Its capabilities have positioned us to go the next level as a global enterprise regarding contract management. We have received top-notch service [from] the Icertis team. As one of my company&rsquo;s lawyers, what I like most is its automation features that allow business teams to handle more contracts without escalation to legal.&rdquo;</p>
<p>- <a style="color: #fff; text-decoration: underline !important; white-space: nowrap;" href="https://www.gartner.com/reviews/market/contract-life-cycle-management/vendor/icertis/product/icertis-contract-intelligence-ici/review/view/6653172?utm_source=icertis&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_campaign=ReviewSnippets">Manufacturing customer</a> <strong>with more than $30 billion in annual revenue</strong>.</p>
        </div>
</div>

<div class="homepage-testimonials__card-inner">
    <div class="homepage-testimonials__card-left">
            <div class="homepage-testimonials__card-image">
                <img src="/globalassets/home-review-logo.png" alt="" />
            </div>

    </div>

        <div class="homepage-testimonials__card-content rich-text-area">
            
<p>"The addition of Icertis Copilot and related AI capabilities allow users to automatically generate clear executive summaries from complex agreements in the 100-150 page range into an easily consumable format for leadership stakeholders. As a result, reviewers can focus directly on the issues that matter most instead of wading through every clause. Taken together, these are meaningfully reducing our CLM cycle times."</p>
<p>- <a style="color: #fff; text-decoration: underline !important; white-space: nowrap;" href="https://www.gartner.com/reviews/market/contract-life-cycle-management/vendor/icertis/product/icertis-contract-intelligence-ici/review/view/5797182">Telecommunications customer</a> <strong>with up to $30 billion in annual revenue.</strong></p>
        </div>
</div>

                        </div>
                    </div>

